## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Compass for AD Stalkers|r 1.0.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: For two named players only. A translucent compass ring around the screen-centre reticle: N, E, S and W turn with the camera, and your group members appear inside the ring in the direction they are from you, nearer the centre the closer they are.
